						<paragraph>Your organization electronically submitted an initial case report to determine if reporting to public health is needed for a patient.</paragraph>
						<paragraph>"Influenza (disorder)" is reportable to "Tennessee Department of Health". The initial case report was sent to "Tennessee Department of Health". Additional information may be required for this report.<br/>
						</paragraph>
						<paragraph>The trigger code version your organization is using is out-of-date. Please have your EHR administrators install the current version for complete eCR functioning.<br/>
						</paragraph>
						<paragraph>
							<content styleCode="Bold">"Influenza (disorder)" for "Tennessee Department of Health" </content>
						</paragraph>
